        "description": "Searches and plays SoundCloud. Takes the client_id from the secret store, and otherwise discovers it itself. Gives the track's cover and its related tracks. `*.sndcdn.com`: the web client's JS assets (a-v2), the audio stream (cf-media) and the covers (i1) are under this domain.",
